* Process corners for
* benchmarks/design-agent/reference/charge-pump-pll/pll.spice.
*
* Self-contained, PDK-free stand-in for a real .lib -- the identical
* corner_cap/corner_iref knobs relaxation-vco/models.lib and
* rc-relaxation-oscillator/models.lib both use, since pll.spice's own
* vco_core subcircuit is a verbatim copy of relaxation-vco's own VCO and
* is scaled by the same two process knobs. Replace this file with a real
* PDK model library (e.g. sky130's sky130.lib.spice) once the VCO and
* charge pump are built out of real devices -- see README.md's "Known
* limitations" note.

.lib tt
.param corner_cap=1.00
.param corner_iref=1.00
.endl tt

.lib ss
.param corner_cap=1.10
.param corner_iref=0.95
.endl ss

.lib ff
.param corner_cap=0.90
.param corner_iref=1.05
.endl ff
